@startuml
title Login Process

actor User
participant LoginFrame
participant SystemController
participant AuthenticationService
database HospitalRepository

User -> LoginFrame: enter username and password
LoginFrame -> SystemController: login(username, password)
SystemController -> AuthenticationService: login(username, password)
AuthenticationService -> HospitalRepository: getUsers()
HospitalRepository --> AuthenticationService: users
AuthenticationService --> SystemController: matching User or null
SystemController --> LoginFrame: login result

alt valid credentials
  LoginFrame -> LoginFrame: open DashboardFrame by role
else invalid credentials
  LoginFrame -> User: show error message
end
@enduml
